A: Наш, our, goes like мой: на́ши де́ти, о на́ших де́тях, and in the dialogue, в на́шем до́ме.
    text y1 "на́ши де́ти · о на́ших де́тях" say "на́ши де́ти, о на́ших де́тях" new ["на́ши","на́ших","де́ти","де́тях"] x 500 y 540 font_size 54
    text y1g "our: like мой" #8f887c x 500 y 475 font_size 30

A: Неда́вно, recently: the opposite of давно́.
    text y2 "неда́вно ↔ давно́" say "неда́вно, давно́" new ["неда́вно"] x 500 y 340 font_size 56
    text y2g "recently ↔ for a long time" #8f887c x 500 y 275 font_size 30

    erase y1 y1g y2 y2g

    show nina nina_name1 nina_name2 tom tom_name

    ask "How many children does her son (сын) have?" listen [{"voice":"b","who":"Ни́на Петро́вна","text":"Мой сын живёт в Москве́. У него́ одна́ дочь.","gloss":"My son lives in Moscow. He has one daughter."},{"voice":"a","who":"Tom","text":"А у ва́шей до́чери есть де́ти?","gloss":"And does your daughter have children?"},{"voice":"b","who":"Ни́на Петро́вна","text":"Да, три сы́на. Они́ живу́т о́коло па́рка.","gloss":"Yes, three sons. They live near the park."}] options ["one daughter","two sons","three sons"] correct 1 transcript false reveal.text "одна́ дочь" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        intro: Six questions now, then your score.
        right: У него́ одна́ дочь: one daughter.
        wrong: Listen for у него́.

    erase question_5_stamp

    ask "Where do her daughter's children live?" listen same options ["near the park","in Moscow","near the station"] correct 1 reveal.text "о́коло па́рка" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        right: Три сы́на, о́коло па́рка: three sons, near the park.
        wrong: О́коло is near.

    erase question_6_stamp

    hide nina nina_name1 nina_name2 tom tom_name

    icon q_kids size 130 set twemoji x 430 y 520 or ["child"] icon_look picture of boy
    icon q_kids2 size 130 set twemoji x 570 y 520 or ["child"] icon_look picture of girl

    quiz "Вы́берите. Мы игра́ем в па́рке с ___." reveal.text "с детьми́" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: С, with, takes the with-ending, and де́ти has its own: -ьми.
