    '|a||Plural cases in Russian: дети, детей, детьми':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Tea and a family photo with Нина Петровна: the Russian plural in all six cases in one table, and the family words that break it: дети, люди, сыновья, дочери.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 14360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1e6endy'
    '|a||Ве́чер. Tea next door at Ни́на Петро́вна''s, and out comes a family photo.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6360
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1200
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:rqcou9'
