      ms: 2760
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:fpqb5c'
    '|b||Да, сын и дочь. Сын живёт в Москве́, а дочь — здесь, в Петербу́рге.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5640
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
