      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:803muj'
    '|a||Лю́ди goes just like де́ти. Запо́лните про́пуски.':
