      ms: 2080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:hevrj8'
    '|a||Лю́ди, люде́й, люде́й, лю́дям, с людьми́, о лю́дях.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6920
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Детьми́, людьми́, and дочерьми́ too: a rare -ьми, where almost everything else takes -ами.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:hy3246'
    '|a||Back to the tea. Then tap Practise after the dialogue, and be Tom yourself.':
