      ms: 6120
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1minkq3'
    '|a||Наш, our, goes like мой: на́ши де́ти, о на́ших де́тях, and in the dialogue, в на́шем до́ме.':
